==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|trk|ru}} *{{term||karadaš|black stone}}. Compare Turkish {{term|karataş||black slate|lang=tr}}, composed of {{term|kara||black|lang=tr}} + {{term|taş||stone|lang=tr}}.

